<section class="ziyu-section">
  <div class="ziyu-container">
    <div style="max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 90px;">
      <span class="ziyu-label">Journal</span>
      <h1 class="ziyu-h1">Field notes from building slower technology.</h1>
      <p class="ziyu-body-lg" style="margin-top: 28px;">Essays, reflections, build notes, and philosophy from the Ziyu archive.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ziyu-grid-3">
      <article class="ziyu-card">
        <div style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;">
          <img class="ziyu-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead277a?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Writing">
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 28px;">
          <span class="ziyu-label ziyu-label--muted">Philosophy · 12 min read</span>
          <h2 class="ziyu-h4">The ethics of intentional disconnection</h2>
          <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 14px;">Exploring the boundaries between digital utility and human presence.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ziyu-card">
        <div style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;">
          <img class="ziyu-image ziyu-grayscale" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Quiet space">
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 28px;">
          <span class="ziyu-label ziyu-label--muted">Practice · 8 min read</span>
          <h2 class="ziyu-h4">Designing your physical sanctuary</h2>
          <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 14px;">How environment shapes cognitive load and deep work.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ziyu-card">
        <div style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;">
          <img class="ziyu-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517971071642-34a2d3ecc9cd?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Paper">
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 28px;">
          <span class="ziyu-label ziyu-label--muted">Essay · 15 min read</span>
          <h2 class="ziyu-h4">The permanence of the printed word</h2>
          <p class="ziyu-body" style="margin-top: 14px;">Why physical artifacts still matter in an ephemeral age.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

